  "text": "```verilog\nmodule apbslave #(\n\t\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\t\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\t\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\t\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\t\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n\t) (\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\t\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\t\toutput\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\t\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n\t);\n\n\t// Internal register file\n\treg [DW-1:0] mem [0:(2**(AW-APBLSB)-1)];\n\n\t// State machine\n\treg [1:0] state;\n\tlocalparam S_IDLE = 2'd0;\n\tlocalparam S_SETUP = 2'd1;\n\tlocalparam S_ACCESS = 2'd2;\n\n\t// Latch address and write data during setup phase\n\treg [AW-1:0] addr_latch;\n\treg [DW-1:0] wdata_latch;\n\treg [DW/8-1:0] wstrb_latch;\n\treg write_latch;\n\n\t// PSLVERR output\n\tassign PSLVERR = 1'b0;\n\n\t// State machine logic\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\taddr_latch <= {AW{1'b0}};\n\t\t\twdata_latch <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\t\twstrb_latch <= {(DW/8){1'b0}};\n\t\t\twrite_latch <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tcase (state)\n\t\t\t\tS_IDLE: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PSEL) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_SETUP;\n\t\t\t\t\t\taddr_latch <= PADDR;\n\t\t\t\t\t\twdata_latch <= PWDATA;\n\t\t\t\t\t\twstrb_latch <= PWSTRB;\n\t\t\t\t\t\twrite_latch <= PWRITE;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tS_SETUP: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_ACCESS;\n\t\t\t\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tS_ACCESS: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (write_latch) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// Perform write\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor (genvar i = 0; i < DW/8; i = i + 1) begin : write_loop\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif (wstrb_latch[i]) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmem[addr_latch[AW-1:APBLSB]][i*8 +: 8] <= wdata_latch[i*8 +: 8];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// Perform read\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= mem[addr_latch[AW-1:APBLSB]];\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tdefault: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tendcase\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
